            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9c3a94' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='15'>Purpose/ Description</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>- Performance tracking for Corporate Ops Cases</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>- Refreshes Daily</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#9c3a94' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='15'>How to use the dashboard (tabs)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Performance Overview: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>To track overall Ops Case performance for Live and Non-Live cases with visualisations that show key insights</run>
